{
    "title": "Spades: Classic Card Games",
    "description": "Play a FREE Spades card game on your Android device, made by MobilityWare!\r\n\r\nThis fun trickster cards game is the classic Spades but with a fresh new look on Google Play, plus brand new goals for you to reach! \r\n\r\nIf you enjoy popular free card games like Hearts, Rummy, Euchre, or Pinochle, then you\u2019ll love this social Spades game. It is often compared to Poker, but instead of betting with chips and bluffing, it's a trick-taking card game where players rely on their card-playing skills and communication to win tricks and reach their bid with each level. Whether you were taught Spades by a family member or a friend, practice will allow you to develop the best strategy. \r\n\r\nPlus, we\u2019ve also included tutorials to help you learn this fun and free Spades game at your own pace! Relax and train your brain, or go multiplayer with friends online and offline to compete in this social and classic trickster cards game of Spades! You\u2019ll enjoy it if you love popular free card games like Euchre, Pinochle, Rummy, and Hearts. \r\n\r\nThis Spades app adds a new element of strategy to the classic card game space. Play this popular trickster card game to sharpen your brain and relax! Plus, players who love fun free card games like Hearts, Rummy, and Pinochle are sure to have a blast playing this trickster cards game app!\r\n\r\nSo what are you waiting for? Plan and strategize each move as you compete with a partner or multiplayer with friends to try and outbid and outplay your opponents at each level in this fun and free Spades game. Win the most books and be the first to get 250 points to win! Be careful, spade cards can only be played once they\u2019re broken! You\u2019ll need precision and strategy to master this social, trickster cards game! If you love free card games like Pinochle, Hearts and Rummy, then you\u2019re sure to love Spades!\r\n\r\nSPADES APP FEATURES:\r\nPlay the classic and relaxing version of Spades:\r\n- Hop into the classic Spades card gameplay you love\r\n- Drop-in-drop-out gameplay means Spades app is ready to play whenever you are!\r\n- Use expressive emojis to let your opponent know you are winning\r\n- Play online/offline \u2013 bots are available to play whenever and wherever\r\n- Need help? Use unlimited hints and undos\r\n\r\nIntroducing Special Opponents!\r\n- Face off against a new competitor every month! Plus, earn unique boosters, hats, emotes, and avatars to show off to your friends\r\n- Embrace the rivalry and become the champion you were meant to be\r\n\r\nThe classic Spades game, for free and for beginners and Pros alike:\r\n- Go multiplayer with friends, over 300 titles to earn and collect throughout levels\r\n- Track your high scores across several games\r\n- Improve your card play with statistics. Watch as you improve your strategy each game\r\n\r\nPlay classic Spades online and offline, whenever, wherever you want:\r\n- Choose the difficulty of AI and the rules of this social, popular and free Spades game\r\n- Choose either portrait or landscape to play\r\n- Never lose a game with save states, even when the app closes\r\n- Add sandbags or jump into hard playing mode for more challenge\r\n\r\nTrain your brain with friends for competitive and social Spades gameplay and challenges:\r\n\u2013 For beginners and pros alike! Learn to master the free card games of Spades alone or in multiplayer mode to improve your strategy each level\r\n- Use Instructions to build your Spades strategy, both in game and with your friends\r\n- Plus up your card skills with online and offline play! Plus, track your multiplayer stats with friends in the app and watch as your Spades game improves\r\n\r\nIf playing free card games like Hearts, Rummy, Euchre, Pinochle, or Poker is what you enjoy, then you\u2019ll love the popular trickster cards game of Spades. Play this free Spades appa alone or go multiplayer with friends online or offline!\r\n\r\nhttps://www.mobilityware.com/spades\r\n\r\nLIKE US on Facebook\r\nhttp://www.facebook.com/mobilitywaresolitaire\r\n\r\nNEED SUPPORT?\r\nHave a question? Lay it on us. We are here to help.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.mobilityware.com/support.php",
    "descriptionHTML": "Play a FREE Spades card game on your Android device, made by MobilityWare!<br><br>This fun trickster cards game is the classic Spades but with a fresh new look on Google Play, plus brand new goals for you to reach! <br><br>If you enjoy popular free card games like Hearts, Rummy, Euchre, or Pinochle, then you\u2019ll love this social Spades game. It is often compared to Poker, but instead of betting with chips and bluffing, it&#39;s a trick-taking card game where players rely on their card-playing skills and communication to win tricks and reach their bid with each level. Whether you were taught Spades by a family member or a friend, practice will allow you to develop the best strategy. <br><br>Plus, we\u2019ve also included tutorials to help you learn this fun and free Spades game at your own pace! Relax and train your brain, or go multiplayer with friends online and offline to compete in this social and classic trickster cards game of Spades! You\u2019ll enjoy it if you love popular free card games like Euchre, Pinochle, Rummy, and Hearts. <br><br>This Spades app adds a new element of strategy to the classic card game space. Play this popular trickster card game to sharpen your brain and relax! Plus, players who love fun free card games like Hearts, Rummy, and Pinochle are sure to have a blast playing this trickster cards game app!<br><br>So what are you waiting for? Plan and strategize each move as you compete with a partner or multiplayer with friends to try and outbid and outplay your opponents at each level in this fun and free Spades game. Win the most books and be the first to get 250 points to win! Be careful, spade cards can only be played once they\u2019re broken! You\u2019ll need precision and strategy to master this social, trickster cards game! If you love free card games like Pinochle, Hearts and Rummy, then you\u2019re sure to love Spades!<br><br>SPADES APP FEATURES:<br>Play the classic and relaxing version of Spades:<br>- Hop into the classic Spades card gameplay you love<br>- Drop-in-drop-out gameplay means Spades app is ready to play whenever you are!<br>- Use expressive emojis to let your opponent know you are winning<br>- Play online/offline \u2013 bots are available to play whenever and wherever<br>- Need help? Use unlimited hints and undos<br><br>Introducing Special Opponents!<br>- Face off against a new competitor every month! Plus, earn unique boosters, hats, emotes, and avatars to show off to your friends<br>- Embrace the rivalry and become the champion you were meant to be<br><br>The classic Spades game, for free and for beginners and Pros alike:<br>- Go multiplayer with friends, over 300 titles to earn and collect throughout levels<br>- Track your high scores across several games<br>- Improve your card play with statistics. Watch as you improve your strategy each game<br><br>Play classic Spades online and offline, whenever, wherever you want:<br>- Choose the difficulty of AI and the rules of this social, popular and free Spades game<br>- Choose either portrait or landscape to play<br>- Never lose a game with save states, even when the app closes<br>- Add sandbags or jump into hard playing mode for more challenge<br><br>Train your brain with friends for competitive and social Spades gameplay and challenges:<br>\u2013 For beginners and pros alike! Learn to master the free card games of Spades alone or in multiplayer mode to improve your strategy each level<br>- Use Instructions to build your Spades strategy, both in game and with your friends<br>- Plus up your card skills with online and offline play! Plus, track your multiplayer stats with friends in the app and watch as your Spades game improves<br><br>If playing free card games like Hearts, Rummy, Euchre, Pinochle, or Poker is what you enjoy, then you\u2019ll love the popular trickster cards game of Spades. Play this free Spades appa alone or go multiplayer with friends online or offline!<br><br>https://www.mobilityware.com/s